---
subject: "Redefina sua senha — {{tenantName}} 🔐"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="dark">
  <title>Redefina sua senha — {{tenantName}}</title>
  <!--[if mso]>
  <noscript>
    <xml>
      <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
        <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
      </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
    </xml>
  </noscript>
  <![endif]-->
  <style type="text/css">
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
    body { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse !important; }
    img { border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }
    @media screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .email-wrapper { width: 100% !important; }
      .email-pad { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }
      .email-title { font-size: 24px !important; }
      .email-cta a { display: block !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; width:100%; background-color:#0B0E1E; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

  {{!-- ============ PREHEADER (texto de preview, oculto no corpo) ============ --}}
  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#0B0E1E; opacity:0;">
    Clique no link para redefinir sua senha na {{tenantName}}. Se não foi você, ignore este e-mail.
    &nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color:#0B0E1E;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

        <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" class="email-wrapper" style="width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#12161F;">

          {{!-- ==================== SEÇÃO 1 — HEADER ==================== --}}
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="{{primaryColor}}" height="3" style="height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0; background-color:{{primaryColor}};">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#0B0E1E" class="email-pad" style="padding:28px 24px 32px 24px; background-color:#0B0E1E; background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #0B0E1E 0%, #1B0F2E 100%); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">

              {{!-- PLATAFORMA — quem de fato envia o e-mail.
                   Hoje é texto; se platformLogoUrl for enviado no payload, vira imagem sem alterar o template. --}}
              {{#if platformLogoUrl}}
                <img src="{{platformLogoUrl}}" width="72" alt="Atlee" style="display:block; margin:0 auto; width:72px; max-width:72px; height:auto; border:0;">
              {{else}}
                <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; line-height:16px; letter-spacing:4px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#64748B;">Atlee</p>
              {{/if}}

              {{!-- Divisória curta: separa plataforma de tenant sem criar uma segunda barra forte --}}
              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin:18px auto;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="32" height="1" style="width:32px; height:1px; line-height:1px; font-size:0; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              {{!-- ATLÉTICA (tenant) — logo é opcional, nome sempre aparece --}}
              {{#if tenantLogoUrl}}
              <img src="{{tenantLogoUrl}}" width="96" alt="" style="display:block; margin:0 auto 14px auto; width:96px; max-width:96px; height:auto; border:0;">
              {{/if}}
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; line-height:22px; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; color:{{primaryColor}};">{{tenantName}}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          {{!-- ==================== SEÇÃO 2 — TÍTULO + SUBTÍTULO ==================== --}}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#0F1420" class="email-pad" style="padding:32px 24px 24px 24px; background-color:#0F1420;">
              <p class="email-title" style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; line-height:34px; color:#F1F5F9;">Redefina sua senha 🔐</p>
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:400; line-height:22px; color:#94A3B8;">Crie uma nova senha para acessar sua conta</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          {{!-- ==================== SEÇÃO 3 — CONTEÚDO ==================== --}}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#12161F" class="email-pad" style="padding:32px 24px; background-color:#12161F;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; line-height:24px; color:#F1F5F9;">Olá, {{#if studentName}}{{studentName}}{{else}}estudante{{/if}}!</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 28px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:400; line-height:24px; color:#94A3B8;">Recebemos uma solicitação para redefinir a senha da sua conta na {{tenantName}}. Clique no botão abaixo para criar uma nova senha:</p>

              {{!-- ---------- BOTÃO CTA ---------- --}}
              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="email-cta" style="width:100%;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="{{primaryColor}}" style="border-radius:12px; background-color:{{primaryColor}};">
                    <a href="{{resetPasswordUrl}}" target="_blank" style="display:block; padding:15px 32px; min-height:18px; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; line-height:18px; color:{{contrastColor primaryColor primaryColorForeground}}; text-decoration:none; text-align:center; border-radius:12px;">Redefinir senha</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:20px 0 0 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; line-height:20px; color:#64748B; text-align:center; word-break:break-all;">
                Se o botão não funcionar, copie e cole este link no navegador:<br>
                <a href="{{resetPasswordUrl}}" target="_blank" style="color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:underline; word-break:break-all;">{{resetPasswordUrl}}</a>
              </p>

              {{#if passwordResetLinkExpirationHours}}
              <p style="margin:20px 0 0 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; line-height:20px; color:#64748B; text-align:center;">Esse link expira em {{passwordResetLinkExpirationHours}} horas.</p>
              {{/if}}

              <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; line-height:22px; color:#64748B; text-align:center;">Se você não solicitou a redefinição de senha, ignore este e-mail. Sua senha atual permanecerá a mesma.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          {{!-- ==================== SEÇÃO 4 — RODAPÉ BRANDED ==================== --}}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#0D1117" class="email-pad" style="padding:32px 24px 24px 24px; background-color:#0D1117; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; line-height:18px; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:{{primaryColor}};">{{tenantName}}</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; font-style:italic; line-height:18px; color:#64748B;">Onde a tradição encontra a festa</p>

              {{#if instagramUrl}}
              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:0 10px;">
                    <a href="{{instagramUrl}}" target="_blank" style="font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:18px; color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none;">📷 Instagram</a>
                  </td>
                  {{#if whatsappNumber}}
                  <td style="padding:0 10px;">
                    <a href="https://wa.me/{{whatsappNumber}}" target="_blank" style="font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:18px; color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none;">💬 WhatsApp</a>
                  </td>
                  {{/if}}
                </tr>
              </table>
              {{else}}
                {{#if whatsappNumber}}
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 10px;">
                      <a href="https://wa.me/{{whatsappNumber}}" target="_blank" style="font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:18px; color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none;">💬 WhatsApp</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                {{/if}}
              {{/if}}

              <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; line-height:18px; color:#94A3B8;">
                Precisa de ajuda?
                {{#if whatsappNumber}}
                  <a href="https://wa.me/{{whatsappNumber}}" target="_blank" style="color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">Fale conosco</a>
                {{else}}
                  {{#if supportEmail}}<a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">Fale conosco</a>{{else}}{{#if tenantContactEmail}}<a href="mailto:{{tenantContactEmail}}" style="color:{{secondaryColor}}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">Fale conosco</a>{{else}}<span style="color:{{secondaryColor}}; font-weight:600;">Fale conosco</span>{{/if}}{{/if}}
                {{/if}}
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          {{!-- Faixa da plataforma: fecha o e-mail com a Atlee, espelhando o header --}}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#0D1117" class="email-pad" style="padding:0 24px 26px 24px; background-color:#0D1117;">
              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;">
                <tr>
                  <td height="1" style="height:1px; line-height:1px; font-size:0; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              {{#if platformLogoUrl}}
                <img src="{{platformLogoUrl}}" width="56" alt="Atlee" style="display:block; margin:20px auto 8px auto; width:56px; max-width:56px; height:auto; border:0;">
              {{else}}
                <p style="margin:20px 0 8px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; line-height:16px; letter-spacing:4px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#94A3B8;">Atlee</p>
              {{/if}}
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; line-height:18px; color:#64748B;">A plataforma que a {{tenantName}} usa para ingressos, loja e eventos.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          {{!-- ==================== SEÇÃO 5 — RODAPÉ LEGAL ==================== --}}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#0D1117" class="email-pad" style="padding:0 24px 32px 24px; background-color:#0D1117;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:16px; color:#334155;">
                Enviado por Atlee em nome de {{tenantName}}<br>Brasil
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:16px; color:#334155;">
                Este e-mail foi enviado para {{recipientEmail}}
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:'Inter', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:16px; color:#334155;">
                E-mail transacional — você recebe por ter solicitado a redefinição de senha.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
